{"ticker":"TFC","updated":"2026-10-30T23:15:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Truist Financial Corporation","shortName":"Truist Financial Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.truist.com","fullTimeEmployees":37833,"marketCap":58474254336,"trailingPE":12.574742,"forwardPE":9.929947,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.1993356,"pegRatio":1.12,"targetMeanPrice":53.24474,"targetHighPrice":58.0,"targetLowPrice":45.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.158,"earningsGrowth":-0.462,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.2545,"profitMargins":0.2838,"totalRevenue":18276999168,"beta":0.906,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":56.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":43.13,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.22},"summary":"Truist Financial Corporation, a financial services company, provides banking and trust services in the Southeastern and Mid-Atlantic United States. The company operates through two segments, Consumer and Small Business Banking; and Wholesale Banking. Its deposit products include noninterest-bearing checking, interest-bearing checking, savings, and money market deposit accounts, as well as certificates of deposit and individual retirement accounts. The company also provides funding; asset management; credit card lending; home equity and mortgage lending; other direct retail lending; home mortgage lending; Investment brokerage services; mobile/online banking; payment solutions; point-of-sale lending; retail and small business deposit products; and small business lending. In addition, it offers asset-based lending, commercial deposit and treasury services; commercial lending; floor plan lending; derivatives; institutional trust services; insurance premium finance; international banking; investment banking and capital markets services; leasing; merchant services; mortgage warehouse lending; real estate lending; supply chain financing; and wealth management/private banking. The company was formerly known as BB&T Corporation and changed its name to Truist Financial Corporation in December 2019. Truist Financial Corporation was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Charlotte, North ","summary_zh":"Truist Financial Corporation 是一家金融服務公司，在美國東南部和大西洋中部提供銀行和信託服務。該公司透過兩個部門運作：消費者銀行業務部門和小型企業銀行業務部門；和批發銀行業務。其存款產品包括無利息支票、有息支票、儲蓄和貨幣市場存款帳戶，以及存款證和個人退休帳戶。公司也提供資金；資產管理；信用卡借貸；房屋淨值和抵押貸款；其他直接零售貸款；房屋抵押貸款；投資經紀服務；手機/網路銀行；支付解決方案；銷售點貸款；零售和小型企業存款產品；和小型企業貸款。此外，它還提供以資產為基礎的貸款、商業存款和資金服務；商業貸款；平面圖貸款；衍生性商品；機構信託服務；保費融資；國際銀行業務；投資銀行和資本市場服務；租賃；商戶服務；抵押倉庫借貸；房地產貸款；供應鏈融資；以及財富管理/私人銀行業務。該公司前身為 BB&T Corporation，於 2019 年 12 月更名為 Truist Financial Corporation。 Truist Financial Corporation 成立於 1872 年，總部位於北卡羅來納州夏洛特","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":46.39,"h":46.5,"l":45.82,"c":46.42,"v":6963800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":46.32,"h":46.68,"l":45.85,"c":46.41,"v":5456700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":46.69,"h":47.09,"l":46.39,"c":47.07,"v":5621200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":47.22,"h":47.46,"l":46.24,"c":46.52,"v":7854800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":46.56,"h":46.58,"l":45.59,"c":46.01,"v":6170000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":45.9,"h":46.26,"l":45.11,"c":45.29,"v":12564900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":45.24,"h":45.43,"l":44.82,"c":45.12,"v":10523700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":45.09,"h":45.43,"l":44.88,"c":45.3,"v":7388600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":45.18,"h":45.38,"l":44.9,"c":45.2,"v":8029400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":45.25,"h":45.39,"l":44.58,"c":44.78,"v":6904000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":44.81,"h":44.97,"l":43.99,"c":44.56,"v":6036900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":44.6,"h":45.9,"l":44.51,"c":45.38,"v":9131600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":45.47,"h":46.18,"l":45.22,"c":46.08,"v":7483900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":46.03,"h":46.12,"l":45.59,"c":45.99,"v":19223400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":45.6,"h":45.91,"l":45.16,"c":45.39,"v":6339500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":45.52,"h":46.21,"l":45.44,"c":45.7,"v":8004000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":45.81,"h":47.25,"l":45.48,"c":45.89,"v":8221100},{"t":"2025-09